---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact | Masahiro Sadamura"
  description="Contact information and external profile links for Masahiro Sadamura."
>
  <h1>Contact</h1>

  <p>
    For research, collaboration, citation, or media inquiries, please reach
    out via the following channels.
  </p>

  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>
    <span class="email-obfuscate" data-user="contact" data-domain="sadamura.jp">
      contact [at] sadamura [dot] jp
    </span>
  </p>
  <p>I aim to reply within 1–2 business days, though busy periods may occasionally delay a response.</p>
  <p>
    Information you send is used <strong>only to answer your inquiry and to quote, contract, and deliver paid services</strong>. The full privacy notice is in the <a href="/legal" hreflang="ja">legal disclosures (Japanese)</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>External Profiles</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>URL</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>researchmap</td>
        <td><a href="https://researchmap.jp/sadamuramasahiro?lang=en" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">researchmap.jp/sadamuramasahiro</a></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>ORCID</td>
        <td><a href="https://orcid.org/0009-0008-2248-4583" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">orcid.org/0009-0008-2248-4583</a></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Collaboration Inquiries</h2>
  <p>
    I welcome inquiries about collaborative research in legal psychology, sentencing
    decisions, welfare-oriented support, and NLP/ML applications. To facilitate
    consideration, please include:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your affiliation and area of expertise</li>
    <li>Outline of the research theme or proposal</li>
    <li>Expected form of collaboration (co-authorship, data sharing, commentary, invited talk, etc.)</li>
    <li>Anticipated timeline</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Paid Work</h2>
  <p>
    Paid research and academic support — AI citation audits, Japan research memos,
    graduate admissions coaching, boarding-school admissions strategy, academic
    editing, translation, and data analysis — is listed with prices on the
    <a href="/en/services">Services</a> page. Requests are accepted by e-mail.
  </p>
  <p>I do not provide legal advice on individual matters.</p>

  <h2>Media and Commentary Requests</h2>
  <p>For interviews and commentary on criminal justice, sentencing, and welfare-oriented support, my general policies are:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>I generally cannot comment on specific ongoing cases.</li>
    <li>I can offer commentary based on general principles or research findings, where appropriate.</li>
    <li>For research already presented at conferences or in published papers, I will include relevant publications and presentation materials.</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  document
    .querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.email-obfuscate[data-user][data-domain]')
    .forEach((el) => {
      const u = el.dataset.user;
      const d = el.dataset.domain;
      if (!u || !d) return;
      const addr = `${u}@${d}`;
      const a = document.createElement('a');
      a.href = `mailto:${addr}`;
      a.textContent = addr;
      el.replaceWith(a);
    });
</script>
